# dsh-taskboard's local store (machine state, not project source).
#
# Scoped to the store files only - do NOT widen this to `*`. This deployment
# runs with DSH_HOME inside the git checkout (M-153), so .dsh/ also holds
# tracked config (AGENTS.md, profiles/); a blanket ignore here would hide
# those from git add/status. The taskboard plugin only writes this marker
# when it is absent and leaves an existing one alone, so this narrow rule
# persists across service restarts. If the plugin ever rewrites it back to
# `*`, that is a plugin bug: report it upstream (shengsheng90/DSH-taskboard).
taskboard.sqlite
taskboard.sqlite-shm
taskboard.sqlite-wal
taskboard-attachments/
